    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      499.59,
      298.2,
      562.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      577.59,
      298.21,
      653.66
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land, in total extent of 2.7976 Hectares, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. GA/AKM/2015/527 dated 30.12.2015, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Meththewela in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Akmeemana in the District of Galle in Southern Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
